@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Player" as Player
participant "System" as System

activate Player

    Player -> System : asks to build a station
    activate System

        System --> Player : receives the request, shows the available types \n and asks for the coordinates and the centre
    deactivate System

    Player -> System : selects the type and writes the XY coordinates
    activate System

        System --> Player : receives and validates the coordinates and checks if the terrain \n selected is occupied, asks for the centre (in case of Station), \n and suggests a name for the station based on the closest city
    deactivate System

    Player -> System : types the centre compass coordinate (if Station is chosen)\n and the wanted station name (if not following the recommendation)
    activate System

    System --> Player : receives and shows all data and requests confirmation
        deactivate System

        Player -> System : confirms data
        activate System

        System --> Player : builds the requested station and displays success
        deactivate System


@enduml